'''Common Weapons''' are the easiest [[value]] type to obtain, meaning they typically have simple designs. They are a tier below [[Uncommon Weapons]]. Players can obtain Common Weapons by [[trading]], redeeming [[codes]], purchasing bundles, special events and by purchasing [[boxes]]. 

== List ==
